message: "If you use Moodify in research, please cite it as follows."
title: "Moodify — The Ear of AI"
abstract: >-
  Evidence-first auditory intelligence for AI-generated audio: a frozen
  data-production framework that converts real songs into reproducible,
  inspectable, versioned Auditory Production Cases with standards-backed
  measurement, diagnosis-derived ABC interventions, deterministic algorithmic
  review, and pairwise training data.
